# Cursor agent in sbx

## Workflow

1. Read `.cursor/rules/` and `.claude/skills/workshop-app/SKILL.md` before large edits
2. Prefer existing components (`PageShell`, `LabCard`, `CommandBlock`) over new abstractions
3. Run `npm run build` and `npm run lint` before declaring work done
4. In clone mode, branch first — never commit directly to `main`

## Host vs VM

- Policy and secrets: run `sbx policy` / `sbx secret` on the **host**
- Verify dev server: `sbx exec <name> -- curl http://127.0.0.1:3000`
- Audit network: `sbx policy log <name>`

## MCP (when available)

- Chrome DevTools MCP — verify pages in the forwarded browser URL from `sbx ls`
- Use browser snapshot before claiming UI work is complete
